Package: ladybird
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, fonts-liberation
Recommends: libavcodec61
Provides: www-browser, gnome-www-browser
Description: independent web browser with its own engine (unofficial build)
 Ladybird is a web browser with an engine written from scratch, driven by
 web standards. This is alpha software with no security promises: do not
 rely on it for sensitive browsing.
 .
 This package is built by VitexSoftware. It is NOT an official release of
 the Ladybird Browser Initiative and is not endorsed by it. Qt and other
 third-party libraries are bundled in /opt/ladybird.
